WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
One photo of your cat. A companion on your desktop.
Each pose is drawn on your Mac.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:10.250
A nose-to-nose hello.
Mimi moves closer. Baobao rubs back.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:16.250
Try a gentle stroke, even when your cat is asleep.
Listen for a little murmur.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.250
When they get sleepy, they settle down together.
They keep each other company while you work.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.750
Cat in the way? Pick it up.
Drag it to one side and carry on writing.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.000
Pawture. Open-source desktop pets for macOS.
github.com/zh13662813127-code/Pawture
